  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "The combatants who have been training with their ",
      "skills are leaving for the place where there ",
      "are more stronger monsters. And Navisko is their way. ",
      "They will rest themselves and fix their equipments ",
      "while staying there. But a few days ago, Ump in ",
      "Navisko lost his hammer. It was stolen by the ",
      "Bargons that invaded Navisko. Could you look for ",
      "it? If you see it, please give it back to him. ",
      "",
      "[Quest Subject]",
      "",
      "     After hunting Bargons in the continent ",
      "     and acquiring Ump's hammer, go back to ",
      "     Ump in Navisco.",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      ""
    ]
  },
